  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Want to study in one of New York’s premier colleges? Then, the State University of New York at Geneseo (SUNY Geneseo) is your ideal choice. It’s located in a scenic 220-acre campus, where you can enjoy a lot of green spaces while you study. The college offers you several undergraduate and postgraduate courses to choose from.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>SUNY Geneseo offers small class sizes, so you can get a personalised learning experience and a great interaction with the professors. You’ll be joining a diverse community of international students there. Not just that, you can choose to join from over 80 student clubs and organisations for a fun-filled campus life.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>At SUNY Geneseo, you'll find several accommodation options located near the main campus. You can choose between residence halls, suites, or townhouse-style communities. Plus, each option includes essential furniture, utilities, and access to communal spaces.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>Additionally, if you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>The library on campus is filled with all the necessary study and resource spaces you need.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong><br>If you’re into sports, you’ve got loads of options. SUNY Geneseo is home to the NCAA Division III Geneseo Knights and also has modern stadiums, pools, arenas, and courts.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>You’ll find modern labs and research facilities on campus. One notable space is the USD 53 million Integrated Science Centre, where you’ll find the only Pelletron particle accelerator in Western New York.</p><p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>You’ll find a lot of on-campus dining options, including the 1871 Cafe and the Red Jacket Dining Complex. Additionally, you’ll also find various cafes and restaurants in the village of Geneseo.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
